<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $147 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $147 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Thursday it placed $147 million in overnight repurchase agreements at nine percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, overnight call money was unchanged at 6.15 percent from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar was higher at 0.99985 pesos from 0.99984 pesos at the close Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668</p>
</text>
